{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960330/extras/fa7a7eed9bb706a301e841706a81686a.avif?t=1751297400\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960330/extras/75b87d187bb4e869a54135ba4a0b1e73.poster.avif?t=1751297400\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960330/extras/75b87d187bb4e869a54135ba4a0b1e73.webm?t=1751297400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960330/extras/75b87d187bb4e869a54135ba4a0b1e73.mp4?t=1751297400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>UNDER THE CONCRETE WAVE is a 3rd person platformer where ypu control robots designed to escape their underground BRUTALISM/CONCRETE habitat and explore the unknown world above ground. What challenges await you as you embark on your journey?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960330/extras/3121db7ab9455d97faf67c5f2222005d.avif?t=1751297400\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960330/extras/9afebe3a1bb07ff1e7d70ee46930ab72.poster.avif?t=1751297400\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960330/extras/9afebe3a1bb07ff1e7d70ee46930ab72.webm?t=1751297400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960330/extras/9afebe3a1bb07ff1e7d70ee46930ab72.mp4?t=1751297400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Rise above the structures that confine you. Look for the hidden paths and ladders that will lead you to higher ground. Do not be afraid to climb and push yourself upward, for the view from the top will be worth the effort. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960330/extras/3311976a46dac1cf3be4a394a2b8a876.avif?t=1751297400\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960330/extras/f0398f0c900c38a699074bb3448cc971.poster.avif?t=1751297400\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960330/extras/f0398f0c900c38a699074bb3448cc971.webm?t=1751297400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960330/extras/f0398f0c900c38a699074bb3448cc971.mp4?t=1751297400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You can make friends with them in different ways \u2014 some might be odd, others cool, some could offer support, while others might need your help. How would you build relationships with them?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960330/extras/90069e4779963cafcce3f5b0b7017862.avif?t=1751297400\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960330/extras/50fff8a48dcf33820277000f286951fb.poster.avif?t=1751297400\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960330/extras/50fff8a48dcf33820277000f286951fb.webm?t=1751297400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960330/extras